            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-RVW_MythTree_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Medusa? She was once human, like you or even Professor Drake, but she was vain and cruel, and had many enemies.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Ivan.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TreeIvan_CEL_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 38275,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-RVW_MythTree_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "In time, she caused such misery that her enemies banded together, and cast a powerful spell to transform her.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Ivan.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TreeIvan_CEL_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 38275,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-RVW_MythTree_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "They hoped it would teach her the error of her ways, but she was all-too-happy in her new form, and she grew even more terrible.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Ivan.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TreeIvan_CEL_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 38275,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-RVW_MythTree_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Eventually, the Medusa destroyed all who could turn her back into human, and she remained a figure of fearful myth.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Ivan.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TreeIvan_CEL_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 38275,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-RVW_MythTree_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Now the Medusa lives for battle, and relishes being summoned to the Spiral. She is a dangerous ally, but a useful one!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Ivan.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TreeIvan_CEL_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 38275,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-RVW_MythTree_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Undoubtedly, Professor Drake means well to teach you that spell, but you should ask him to explain more.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Ivan.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TreeIvan_CEL_06.mp3",
